      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HIGH COURT JUDGE (1) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 0.8 lengths (30.65) behind No Reigns at this track. Makes plenty of appeal. RYEBUCK BANJO (4) still a maiden after seven runs but rarely out of the placings. Hasn't been able to break through recently but continues to race well, filling the minors at the last four starts. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. BREMER BOY (5) makes his debut from a tricky box and will need a clean break. Can sneak into the finish on debut. DARK EMPRESS (2) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
